[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Evans Gambit"]
[Variation "Italian Game: Evans Gambit, Hein Countergambit"]
[ECO "C51"]
[Character "gambit,sharp"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "centre-fight"]
[For "white"]
[Kind "gambit"]
[Opponent "4...d5"]
[Start "evans-gambit 4.b4"]

4... d5 { Black strikes back in the centre at once instead of taking the pawn. } 5. exd5 { Takes the pawn: if Black grabs b4 White castles and attacks. } 5... Nxb4 6. O-O { Gets the king safe. Black's knight on b4 is far from home and its pawn on e5 is loose. } 6... Nf6 7. Nxe5 { Wins the e5 pawn, which Black cannot guard well because the knight on c6 left. } 7... Nbxd5 8. d4 { Hits the bishop and builds the centre. } 8... Be7 9. Bb2 { Puts the bishop on the long diagonal, pointing at g7 and backing up the knight on e5. Plan: Re1, Nc3 and a free game for White. } 9... O-O 10. Re1 *
